        1687,
        1712
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Under current practices, applications for Federal and State aid are in many instances sent directly from a City agency to a Federal or State agency. Because of the growing importance of Federal and State aid, it is essential that we achieve maximum coordination of our efforts. Accordingly, effective immediately, the following procedures should be followed:",
